# Published data ships byte-identical on every platform: no EOL conversion.
#
# Git normalises to LF in the object store, and with core.autocrlf=true (the
# Windows default) it rewrites LF -> CRLF on checkout. For results.csv that is
# not cosmetic: 261 of its newlines sit *inside* quoted `reasoning` fields, so
# a blanket conversion edits the model's own text and the clone no longer
# matches the published bytes or any checksum taken over them.
data/*.csv   -text
data/*.json  -text
data/*.jsonl -text
